{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $48m+42n$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $6$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}48m+42n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{48m+42n}{6}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{48m}{6}+\\dfrac{42n}{6}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6(8m+7n)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $48m+42n$ is equivalent to $6(8m+7n)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $3$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}48m+42n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3\\left(\\dfrac{48m+42n}{3}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3\\left(\\dfrac{48m}{3}+\\dfrac{42n}{3}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3(16m+14n)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $48m+42n$ is equivalent to $3(16m+14n)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $2$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}48m+42n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{48m+42n}{2}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{48m}{2}+\\dfrac{42n}{2}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(24m+21n)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $48m+42n$ is *not* equivalent to $2(12m+21n)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $7$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}48m+42n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=7\\left(\\dfrac{48m+42n}{7}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=7\\left(\\dfrac{48m}{7}+\\dfrac{42n}{7}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=7\\left(\\dfrac{48}{7}m+6n\\right)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $48m+42n$ is *not* equivalent to $7(7m+6n)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $48m+42n$:\n\n- $6(8m+7n)$\n- $3(16m+14n)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $48m+42n$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $48m+42n$.","content":"$6(8m+7n)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $48m+42n$.","content":"$3(16m+14n)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24m+42n$.","content":"$2(12m+21n)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $49m+42n$.","content":"$7(7m+6n)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
